{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"慌てん坊の日奈子サンタクロース、クリスマスの日にやってきた♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！19回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nたぬきさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/25/5136930/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたに1番近い星"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/25/5136930/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/25/5136930/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はラゾーナ川崎で\nサンクエトワールのイベントがありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"信じられないくらいたくさんの方が\n来て下さっていてすごく嬉しくて\nステージに立った瞬間、\nこの光景が嬉しくてびっくりして\nあいた口が塞がりませんでした！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこんなで\nすごく盛り上がったフリーライブと\nサイン会！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近毎日緊張してばかりだったので\n今日のイベント終わってから\n緊張が解れてか、いま少しだけ\n電池が切れちゃって\n明日明後日の握手会のために\n今日早く寝たいと思います。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、すごい短いブログになってしまうんですが。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のクリスマス\nラゾーナ川崎に会いに来て下さった\n皆さんと会えたこと\nすごく嬉しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスは特別な日だもんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンエトでイベントさせてもらえて\n本当に嬉しいし幸せです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもサンクエトワールを\nよろしくお願い致します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもいろいろやりたいです！\nサンエトでたくさん話し合うぞ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/25/5136930/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/25/5136930/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のラゾーナ川崎での写真を\nマネージャーさんが撮ってくれてました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キレイ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/25/5136930/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の名古屋での全国握手会は\n川後さんとペアです٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後さん！\nのぎえいごでの基本の座り位置が\nおとなりなので、\nよく笑いながら寄っかかったり\nクスクスしてます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、のぎえいごの収録があったんだけど\nあることをしたんだけど\n思い切り突き飛ばしてしまいました。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい(ノ_・。)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の握手会よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜✖︎日奈子レーン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は日奈子とひなで聞き間違いが\n多そうだな！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞き間違えて笑うの楽しそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/25/5136930/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこのへんで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n12回目はやっさん それでも僕はまあや推しさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聖夜でも\n胸のがおがお\n止まらない"}],"source":"archive"}